# This repo is one of two sibling folders under the project root - the other is `local/`
# (the MCreator install, dev/test workspaces, third-party test resource packs, session
# artifacts - see docs/DEVELOPMENT.md). Nothing under `local/` is a descendant of this repo, so
# there is nothing to exclude for it here; this file only needs the generic entries below.

# Python cache from tools/*.py
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
.idea/
*.iml
